{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2014-04", "window": 3, "start_date": 1397606400, "end_date": 1398211199, "month_true_total": 30, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 17:48:50 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "9902767", "author": {"steamid": "76561198009739831", "personaname": "Warp5p1d3r", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198009739831/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 13123, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 12879, "last_played": 1665033161, "avatar": "76dce2682675b8e0b1ee69696591301ae971aca5"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is definitely worth a quick romp through or two.  I recently reloaded it and played it on hard, the campaign is sufficient in length and not too long to get you bored of slamming orcs in the face.  Well paced and probably the one of the best 40k games going, shame the multiplayer is dead.", "timestamp_created": 1398194894, "timestamp_updated": 1398194894, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.493946731090545654", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "9902596", "author": {"steamid": "76561198057843432", "personaname": "Solve.Everything.With.Violence", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Sturmbannschnitzel/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 10366, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 9535, "last_played": 1580115739, "avatar": "bab90973ba8d0479d8148b92ee19a56822a7c417"}, "language": "english", "review": "Violent multiplayer fun. A must for any Warhammer 40K fan", "timestamp_created": 1398193711, "timestamp_updated": 1398193711, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "9892348", "author": {"steamid": "76561197987097488", "personaname": "Warmarine", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Warmarine/", "num_games_owned": 2207, "num_reviews": 92, "playtime_forever": 2388, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 945, "last_played": 1614822738, "avatar": "a6116d65d52c910db411da4c1f20f7a0eae1de6d"}, "language": "english", "review": "Ok, here's a proper review/opinion on the game. I think this is by far, one of the greatest Third Person Action game I've ever played BESIDES Darksiders series. The story, as a 40k nutjob as myself, is fantastic even though there are some problems with the connections to the actual 40k lore and logic (though honestly alot of games mess that up). The gameplay makes you feel like a ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ space marine. You don't need cover as the armor is the only cover you'll ever need. The melee attack feels like the touch of the empeor. The only thing I wish they could have work on is the multiplayer. The mulitplayer, I'll be honest, felt a bit tacked and was added at the last minute. Espeically since I did see the alpha build of this game in either 2009 or 2010. What kinda makes me sad about this game is that there probably won't be a sequel which the developer have shared ideas on the story. And to be honest, that the story would be an awesome thing to experience. It might suck but at least we get to see what the interpretation would be like to see that happen.", "timestamp_created": 1398096084, "timestamp_updated": 1398096084, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "9888520", "author": {"steamid": "76561198053245374", "personaname": "Thorpy", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Thorpy96/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 1150, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 991, "last_played": 1628921440, "avatar": "d48e57dc4672700340cfa24a7bd40409dee829f6"}, "language": "english", "review": "Very good Game Multiplayer and Campaign. Never have a Dull Moment in this game!", "timestamp_created": 1398062347, "timestamp_updated": 1398062347, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "9862861", "author": {"steamid": "76561197972982824", "personaname": "Exodus", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Rolline77/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 1084, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 100, "last_played": 1458032424, "avatar": "6ded5371c3305c70da913998ef3a552231cd5751"}, "language": "english", "review": "love this game a classic almost", "timestamp_created": 1397845786, "timestamp_updated": 1397845786, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}]}